            <ArticleTitle>[Differential diagnosis between mechanical and inflammatory lower back pain, therapy options].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>104-108</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.17116/jnevro201611661104-108</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article presents the differential diagnosis between mechanical and inflammatory lower back pain based on clinical and paraclinical evidence. The results of comparative studies of amtolmetinum guacilum (AMG) and celecoxib, as well the CORONA study of its efficacy and cardiovascular safety in ankylosing spondylitis, are also discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
